    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: f97bb592c22e15b1bb9d9e5b623f72ac564b7ac3 -->\n**Clean code; conflicts with main.** It already contains #1131 at a2ec0340 (UI glyph, `edm_at_post`, gap bound). The orbit law refuses by name an unlisted pattern, an unstated `max_orbit_radius` and a radius above it. `Orbit::check` bounds the radius, vector count (1-72) and turns (1-20). The orbit is expanded to explicit moves, so the sim verifies what posts. No unwrap/expect/panic.\n\n**Tests (own head):** motion lib 202, sim 94, tools 70 and app lib 148 pass. sinker_orbit 6, sinker_burn 8, sinker_burn_held 7, posting 17, project_roundtrip 71, mcp 18 and ribbon 12 pass. The ui lib passes 607. Clippy is clean.\n\n**Note:** if #1136 and this PR both merge, the shared fixtures (`sinker_burn.rs`, `sinker_fixture.rs`, `stock_sim_held_tests.rs`) need `orbit: None` plus #1136's `stand`/`pass` fields. That is a second conflict, not covered by the main merge.\n- **Conflicts with main (for the merge-time refresh):** about 28-29 files, ~59 hunks, all from main's wire EDM (#532/#551/#560) and this stack both appending an op, section and family to the same lists.\n  - About 50 hunks are mechanical (keep both): `kinds.rs`, `OpParams` arms, `sel.rs`, `sane.rs`, `params.rs`, `posting.rs`, `project/mod.rs`, ui `icons.rs`/`op_icons.rs`/`panes.rs`/`params_page.rs`, `generate.rs`, `job.rs`, `lathe_voice_tests.rs`, `coarse_laws.rs`.\n  - Judgement: the stored op tag (Wire Contour took 41, so `SinkerBurn` becomes 42, and `KIND_COUNT` and the `ribbon.rs` last-kind assertion follow); `stamp.rs` (the sinker tool/electrode digest against main's \"mounts no library tool\" branch - hand-merge so both survive); `params.rs` DTO ids (no stored id may move).\n  - #1131 must be refreshed first.\n\n_Review by the M5 PR-reviewer agent (mkinney collaborator session, PROCESS_VERSION 32). Reviewed on the PR head; the sinker chain is on hold, so it was not refreshed._\n",
