    "body": "Merged origin/main (cfe2635b) into this branch. Two conflicts, both keep-both:\n- `crates/app/src/operation/stamp.rs`: comment block only (main's \"electrode is stamp_tool's\" note plus this PR's orbit note).\n- `crates/app/src/operation/types/mod.rs`: `pub use` list, kept this PR's `SinkerOrbit`/`SinkerOrbitKind` exports and main's `wire_edm` exports.\nThe op tag for SinkerBurn was already 42 (Wire Contour holds 41), so no renumbering. `git diff origin/main --stat` lists only this PR's 18 files.\n\nVerified: `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-motion -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` clean; app tests sinker_orbit 6, sinker_burn 9, sinker_burn_held 7, posting 17, project_roundtrip 73 and app lib 154 pass.\n\nReady for a re-check.\n",
