    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 0f88bfcabf71e3d9cd0ddcf28ef258468a7a37ee -->\nDelta review of the merge of main at 0f88bfca (on top of the code review at f97bb592). Ready for the maintainer to merge.\n\n- `git show --remerge-diff` shows two hand-resolved hunks, both keep-both: `crates/app/src/operation/stamp.rs` (main's electrode note plus the orbit note) and `crates/app/src/operation/types/mod.rs` (`SinkerOrbit`/`SinkerOrbitKind` re-exports plus main's `wire_edm` exports). Nothing from main dropped, no safety check lost. The old bare `pub use sinker::{SinkerBurnOp, SinkerDatum}` line is correctly replaced by the longer one, no duplicate export.\n- `cargo check -p camcraft-app --tests`: clean.\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test sinker_burn`: 9 passed. `--test sinker_orbit`: 6 passed.\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-motion --lib`: 215 passed, 0 failed, 1 ignored (the PR touches crates/motion).\n- Mergeable with main at time of review.\n\nA maintainer will approve and merge by hand.\n",
