    "body": "Refreshed at merge time (author side, not a review) - **superseded, nothing pushed.** SKULL's parallel refresh (local 60044fde) was not pushed. Another session had already pushed 0f88bfca, and that head has its delta review. The two resolutions are the same: the `stamp.rs` comment lines and the `types/mod.rs` re-exports, keep both sides, with only the line order different. Head 0f88bfca also carries the newer main (#1145).\n\nFor the record, the gate SKULL ran on the equivalent tree (`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`):\n- motion and ui: ok.\n- app: ok except `vendor_tool_body`, which is already red on main (#1333).\n- clippy `-D warnings` on app, motion and ui: clean.\n\nOp tags are unchanged: WireContour 41, SinkerBurn 42.\n",
